<%# DRESA-96: plain-text email to the site contact when a non-curator adds an Educators tile %>
A new tile has been added to the <%= TeSS::Config.site['title_short'] %> Educators page. It is already live.

  Name:    <%= @educator.title %>
  Heading: <%= @educator.heading %>
  Link:    <%= @educator.url %>
  Added by: <%= @user&.name %> (<%= @user ? user_url(@user) : 'unknown' %>)

Description:
<%= @educator.description %>

Check it on the page: <%= educators_url %>
Edit or remove it: <%= edit_educator_url(@educator) %>
